  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Pomegranate_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214753\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pomegranate tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"229\" height=\"229\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Pomegranate tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Trees &amp; bushes</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 107</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 910</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Pomegranate</span><span title=\"Pomegranate(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/pomegranate-35749\" title=\"Pomegranate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1b/Pomegranate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20240219033910\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 1 d 3 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 22</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 17</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Pomegranate trees</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tree</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 107.\n</p><p>Each tree can give up to 13 <a href=\"/wiki/pomegranate-35749\" title=\"Pomegranate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pomegranates</a>, which are collected over 4 harvests.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"toc\"><div class=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Stages</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Buying</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Revival</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Removing</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Stages</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/17/Pomegranate_Tree_Stage_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214724\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree Stage 1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/58/Pomegranate_Tree_Stage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214738\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree Stage 2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Pomegranate_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214753\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/29/Pomegranate_Tree_Dead.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree Dead\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Stage 1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Stage 2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Ready</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dead</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<p><span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> Pomegranate trees can be purchased in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> for 910 <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a> each.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<p>The time between harvests is 1 day and 2 hours for each tree. Each harvest yields additional pomegranates:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ac/Pomegranate_Tree_Harvest_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214628\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree Harvest 2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a0/Pomegranate_Tree_Harvest_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214639\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree Harvest 3\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Pomegranate_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20230416214753\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pomegranate Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2 Pomegranates</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3 Pomegranates</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4 Pomegranates</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Revival</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Pomegranate Tree Revival.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">Pomegranate tree up for revival</span></a><figcaption>Pomegranate tree up for revival</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After the third harvest the tree wilts. A player can ask for another player to revive it by tapping on it and placing a sign on the tree. When another player revives it a final harvest of four pomegranates can be collected before the tree dies.  The helper gets 22 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points by reviving a pomegranate tree.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Removing</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Saw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130211\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Saw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">saw</a> is needed to remove a dead tree from the farm. Note that players may also use a saw to remove the tree after the third harvest instead of placing it up for revival.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/apple-tree-2603\" title=\"Apple Tree (68 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bb/Apple_Tree.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028165803\" title=\"Apple Tree (68 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Apple Tree (68 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/ba